      "writtenOn": "2025-01-17T18:33:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Juan,\n\nThe access_ok() is to check the user space mincore vec.\n\n`pages` are calculated as 4KiB pages in the kernel (from len)\n\nbut the userspace vector will only have sufficient space for 1/4 of that since userspace thinks the page size is 16KB. So userspace is only  required to allocate sufficient vector space for X 16KB pages that cover the length.",
